    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d725">

                <pb facs="0998" n="986" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg986"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 PW/12–2645</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the State-War-Navy Coordinating
                        Committee</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">SWN 3661</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-26">26 December,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary of State</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Trial of War Criminals.</p>
                <table rend="width: 50%" rendition="#center">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell>References:</cell>
                        <cell>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. SWNCC 211/1.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>. SWNCC 211/2.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>. SWNCC 211/3.</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>By informal action on 22 December 1945, the State-War-Navy Coordinating Committee
                    approved SWNCC 211/1,<anchor n="28" xml:id="d725-f1"/> as amended by SWNCC
                        211/2.<anchor n="29" xml:id="d725-f2"/>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0999" n="987" xml:id="pg987"/>
                <p>In approving SWNCC 211/1 as amended, the Committee amended the conclusions in
                    paragraph 2 therein in order to make them consistent with the directive as
                    amended by the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <p>A copy of the paper as amended (SWNCC 211/3)<anchor n="30" xml:id="d725-f3"/> is
                    forwarded for guidance and appropriate implementation.</p>
                <p>A copy of this paper has been forwarded to the Joint Chiefs of Staff for
                    transmittal of the directive at the Appendix to the addresses listed
                    therein.</p>
                <p>Copies of this paper have been forwarded to the War and Navy Departments for
                    their guidance and appropriate implementation.</p>
                <closer>For the State-War-Navy Coordinating Committee: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James Clement Dunn</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chairman</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d725-a1.xml" xpointer="d725-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
